('common-thread','The Common Thread','Chinmay Borah','cocktail','Cocktail','Advanced Craft','Nick & Nora Glass',NULL,'Comorin, Gurgaon',NULL,NULL,'Created at Comorin Gurgaon by Chinmay Borah, this aromatic cocktail weaves earthy north-Indian khus (vetiver) root with botanical gin for a silky, nostalgic monsoon finish.','https://static.livcheers.com/static/icons/future_icons_images/52-comorin-gurgaon-product-1-20260912.webp',TRUE,TRUE,'{"mixologist":"Chinmay Borah","bar":"Comorin, Gurgaon","baseSpirit":"Sous-Vide Vetiver Gin & Dry Vermouth","glassware":"Nick & Nora Glass","difficulty":"Advanced Craft","ingredients":["60ml Vetiver-root infused Greater Than or Stranger & Sons Gin","15ml Chamomile & Vetiver cordial","10ml Dry French Vermouth","2 dashes Grapefruit Bitters"],"story":"Created at Comorin Gurgaon by Chinmay Borah, this aromatic cocktail weaves earthy north-Indian khus (vetiver) root with botanical gin for a silky, nostalgic monsoon finish.","color":"from-amber-500/20 to-emerald-600/20"}'::jsonb),
('hemus-highball','Hemu''s Highball','Sahil Gaur','cocktail','Cocktail','Signature Highball','Tall Collins Glass',NULL,'AaBbCc, NCR',NULL,NULL,'Sahil Gaur elevates the classic whisky highball by pairing tropical roasted pineapple notes with three-wood Indian single malt and smoky cardamom.','https://static.livcheers.com/static/icons/future_icons_images/59-aabbcc-product-1-20260912.webp',TRUE,TRUE,'{"mixologist":"Sahil Gaur","bar":"AaBbCc, NCR","baseSpirit":"Indian Single Malt & Smoked Pineapple","glassware":"Tall Collins Glass","difficulty":"Signature Highball","ingredients":["50ml Indri Trini Single Malt Whisky","25ml Charred Pineapple & Black Cardamom Shrub","90ml Artisanal Ginger Ale","Dehydrated pineapple crown garnish"],"story":"Sahil Gaur elevates the classic whisky highball by pairing tropical roasted pineapple notes with three-wood Indian single malt and smoky cardamom.","color":"from-yellow-500/20 to-amber-700/20"}'::jsonb),
('mary-me-martini','Mary Me Martini','Rohit Jana','cocktail','Cocktail','Molecular Clarified','Chilled Coupe',NULL,'RED, Vasant Vihar',NULL,NULL,'Rohit Jana reimagines the savory Bloody Mary into a crystal-clear, razor-sharp martini bursting with umami richness and zero heaviness.','https://static.livcheers.com/static/icons/future_icons_images/70-red-vasant-vihar-product-1-20260912.webp',TRUE,TRUE,'{"mixologist":"Rohit Jana","bar":"RED, Vasant Vihar","baseSpirit":"Clarified Tomato Vodka & Herb Oil","glassware":"Chilled Coupe","difficulty":"Molecular Clarified","ingredients":["60ml Grey Goose Vodka rested with sun-dried cherry tomatoes","20ml Clarified heirloom tomato & celery consommé","5ml Dry Sherry","3 drops Fresh Basil & Black Pepper oil"],"story":"Rohit Jana reimagines the savory Bloody Mary into a crystal-clear, razor-sharp martini bursting with umami richness and zero heaviness.","color":"from-rose-500/20 to-amber-500/20"}'::jsonb),
('highland-botanist','The Highland Botanist','Rishabh Mehrotra','cocktail','Cocktail','Modern Classic','Rocks Glass over Clear Ice Sphere',NULL,'Ophelia, Delhi',NULL,NULL,'Featured at Ophelia Delhi, Rishabh Mehrotra bridges rugged Scottish heather honey notes with bright Mediterranean botanicals.','https://static.livcheers.com/static/icons/future_icons_images/68-ophelia-delhi-product-1-20260912.webp',TRUE,TRUE,'{"mixologist":"Rishabh Mehrotra","bar":"Ophelia, Delhi","baseSpirit":"Blended Scotch & Elderflower","glassware":"Rocks Glass over Clear Ice Sphere","difficulty":"Modern Classic","ingredients":["50ml Chivas Regal 12 YO or Johnnie Walker Black Label","20ml Wild Elderflower Liqueur","15ml Fresh Lime & Rosemary infusion","Smoked rosemary sprig"],"story":"Featured at Ophelia Delhi, Rishabh Mehrotra bridges rugged Scottish heather honey notes with bright Mediterranean botanicals.","color":"from-emerald-500/20 to-gold-500/20"}'::jsonb),
('bilvananda','Bilvananda','Souvik Rana','cocktail','Cocktail','Indigenous Forage','Old Fashioned Tumbler',NULL,'CND Speakeasy',NULL,NULL,'Souvik Rana celebrates forgotten Indian fruit by marrying caramel-rich Kentucky Bourbon with sacred roasted wood apple nectar.','https://static.livcheers.com/static/icons/future_icons_images/51-cnd-speakeasy-product-2-20260912.webp',TRUE,TRUE,'{"mixologist":"Souvik Rana","bar":"CND Speakeasy","baseSpirit":"Bourbon & Wood Apple (Bael)","glassware":"Old Fashioned Tumbler","difficulty":"Indigenous Forage","ingredients":["60ml Maker''s Mark or Jim Beam Bourbon","20ml Roasted Bael (Wood Apple) & Jaggery reduction","2 dashes Angostura Aromatic Bitters","Expressed orange peel coin"],"story":"Souvik Rana celebrates forgotten Indian fruit by marrying caramel-rich Kentucky Bourbon with sacred roasted wood apple nectar.","color":"from-orange-500/20 to-amber-800/20"}'::jsonb),
('albatross','Albatross','Rajat Tolia','cocktail','Cocktail','Mediterranean Spritz','Stemless Wine Goblet',NULL,'Olive Bar & Kitchen, Delhi',NULL,NULL,'Designed for sun-drenched courtyard afternoons at Olive Qutub, Rajat Tolia pairs citrus-forward craft gin with crisp champagne.','https://static.livcheers.com/static/icons/future_icons_images/67-olive-bar-kitchen-delhi-product-1-20260912.webp',TRUE,TRUE,'{"mixologist":"Rajat Tolia","bar":"Olive Bar & Kitchen, Delhi","baseSpirit":"Indian Craft Gin & Salted Pomelo","glassware":"Stemless Wine Goblet","difficulty":"Mediterranean Spritz","ingredients":["50ml Jaisalmer Indian Craft Gin","30ml Pink Pomelo & Kaffir Lime Juice","15ml Salted Honey & Thyme Syrup","Top with Moët & Chandon Impérial Brut"],"story":"Designed for sun-drenched courtyard afternoons at Olive Qutub, Rajat Tolia pairs citrus-forward craft gin with crisp champagne.","color":"from-teal-500/20 to-amber-500/20"}'::jsonb)
